    "created_at": "2018-10-02T01:34:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-10-02T01:34:48Z",
    "body": "> I tried the semi-complicated example in the spec, but as far as I can tell the simple algorithm (i.e. form owner = closest(\"form\")) still works in that snippet.\r\n\r\nI agree that the example doesn't describe the reason of the complexity.\r\nI made an example; http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=6241\r\n\r\nIntroducing \"parser-override form owner\" would simplify the specification.\r\nHowever, UA might need to maintain ```<form>``` pointers from form-associated elements even if they were not associated by parser for performance optimization, and might continue to implement the current algorithm.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
